Falsifies `system_tests::user::process_tests::a_members_exit_ends_its_process_and_the_supervisor_hears`.

Architecture: aarch64, riscv64, x86_64

The defect, in milestone 812 (`std::thread::spawn` runs real threads in one address space)'s process object: `SYSCALL_EXIT` from a member ends only that member, as
`SYSCALL_EXIT_THREAD` would, so its siblings run on in a process that was told to end.

Expected to fail: "the spinner outlived its process: a member's exit did not end it".

diff --git a/kernel/src/sched/process.rs b/kernel/src/sched/process.rs
